WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.882 --> 00:00:08.342
Tonight is movie night.

00:00:18.143 --> 00:00:20.395
In here is the great big world.

00:00:25.733 --> 00:00:28.362
You can go places
your dreams can't dream up.

00:00:32.282 --> 00:00:35.285
Or see things that give
your nightmares nightmares.

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:43.335
Hallelujah!

00:00:50.092 --> 00:00:52.093
In here, you can make your escape.

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.225
I already don't like you.

00:00:58.308 --> 00:01:00.102
Right back at you, sunshine.

00:01:07.818 --> 00:01:10.988
In here, mystery sparks
extraordinary adventure.

00:01:11.572 --> 00:01:14.115
The real mystery is
why everyone's talking to them.

00:01:14.198 --> 00:01:15.617
I thought that was my thing.

00:01:19.997 --> 00:01:23.167
In here, you never know
where the road will take you.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:25.002
Drive!

00:01:25.085 --> 00:01:27.755
When you walk on that court,
you have to think,

00:01:27.838 --> 00:01:29.715
I am the best guy out there.

00:01:29.798 --> 00:01:31.342
I don't care if LeBron's playing.

00:01:35.803 --> 00:01:37.890
In here, the party never stops.

00:01:39.683 --> 00:01:42.978
That's false! I got something to do
in the morning, so it kinda does.

00:01:57.575 --> 00:01:58.743
-You filming this?
-Kinda.

00:01:58.827 --> 00:02:01.080
-You don't have to.
-I know. I'm doing it for me.

00:02:01.163 --> 00:02:02.080
Okay.

00:02:11.882 --> 00:02:14.635
In here, you can make
an incredible discovery.

00:02:17.053 --> 00:02:18.555
Or feel like a kid again.

00:02:18.638 --> 00:02:19.848
Wanna see something cool?

00:02:26.188 --> 00:02:29.525
In here is the great big world.

00:02:30.358 --> 00:02:32.360
And every night is movie night.

